	measure 'CAPEX BUD' = ```
			
			CALCULATE(
			    SUM(Financial_Data[CAPEX_Budget]),
			    FILTER(
			        ALLSELECTED('Calendar'),
			        'Calendar'[Date] <= 
			        CALCULATE(
			            MAX(Financial_Data[Date]),
			            Financial_Data[CAPEX_Actual] <> BLANK()
			        )
			    )
			)
			```
		displayFolder: _02-BUD Measures
		lineageTag: 16faed56-6442-4df7-89a3-f91d9d5db950

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"isGeneralNumber":true}

